  How the .env files of the new target are provisioned: config (config.toml's strategy), example
  (from its template), main (copied from the main checkout) or parent (from the worktree of the
  branch it starts from, --from); defaults to config.toml's strategy

▌› Use config default (example)
   example — copy .env.example → .env
   main — copy .env from the main checkout
   parent — copy .env from source worktree

